===Verb===
{{en-verb|interchang|ing}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} to [[switch]] (each of two things)
#: ''to '''interchange''' places''
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} to [[mutually]] [[give]] and [[receive]] (something); to [[exchange]]
#* Shakespeare
#*: I shall '''interchange''' / My waned state for Henry's regal crown.
# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} to [[swap]] or [[change places]]
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} to [[alternate]]; to [[intermingle]] or [[vary]]
#: ''to '''interchange''' cares with pleasures''

